      "note": [
        "Source: [Population statistics](http://www.scb.se/be0101-en)",
        "The region of birth is based on the country of birth listed in the population register. ",
        "Duration of residence refers to the total amount of time that a person has been registered in the population in Sweden and is specified for persons who have immigrated to Sweden.  Certain foreign citizens who are born in Sweden must apply for a residence permit. They are usually granted a residence permit for the same period as their parents. If the parents do not have a residence permit, the child´s application is examined together with the parent´s application. ",
        "If there are 5 or fewer, the number is entered as (..)"
